{
 "activity_39fa8a06-17de-40ec-87e8-781d3e12d4dc": {
  "name": "Legacy blocks",
  "content": {
   "type": "doc",
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 2
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "From: What customers really want"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Most people who contact a support team are not looking for a perfect experience. They want their problem understood, a fair outcome, a reasonable wait and to be treated with respect. When one of these is missing, even a correct answer can leave a customer unhappy."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 3
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Why the first contact matters"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Customers form their opinion of your company in the first minute of a conversation. Greeting them by name, confirming what they need and telling them what happens next does more for satisfaction than any script. If you cannot solve the issue right away, say so early and explain the next step.",
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "comment",
         "attrs": {
          "threadId": "thread_e7230ced-1071-4c1e-a149-1525ccc75984"
         }
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Throughout this course we will come back to these four needs. Every technique you learn is a way to meet one of them more reliably."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 2
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "From: Your Kitebase dashboard"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "blockLibrary",
     "attrs": {
      "display": "inline"
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 2
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Your Kitebase dashboard"
      }
